<%- include('_policy-head') %>
<section class="section"><div class="container-x max-w-3xl prose-ek">
  <h2>Products</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Damaged or wrong items:</strong> tell us within 48 hours of delivery with a photo and we will replace the item or refund you in full, including delivery.</li>
    <li><strong>Unopened food and accessories:</strong> may be returned within 7 days in original condition for an exchange or store credit. Return delivery is paid by the customer.</li>
    <li><strong>Not returnable:</strong> opened food or treats, supplements and medicines (for safety), and used grooming items.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Bookings cancelled at least 12 hours before the appointment receive a full refund of any advance.</li>
    <li>Late cancellations and no shows may forfeit the advance.</li>
    <li>Boarding stays ended early are charged for the nights used plus one night.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Pet reservation deposits</h2>
  <p>If we cannot hand over a reserved pet (for example it becomes unwell), the deposit is refunded in full. If you change your mind, see the <a href="/animal-sale-policy">Animal Sale Policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>Refunds for eSewa and Khalti payments go back to the same wallet within 7 working days. Cash payments are refunded in cash at the shop or by bank transfer.</p>
</div></section>
